  "body": "This is about the [import()](https://github.com/tc39/proposal-dynamic-import) JavaScript module proposal.\r\n\r\nWebKit is already implementing; we should help them out with a formal spec and tests. (Or, upstream and review their tests.)\r\n\r\nThis is largely prototyped at https://github.com/tc39/proposal-dynamic-import/blob/master/HTML%20Integration.md ; hopefully it won't be very different.\r\n\r\n/cc @whatwg/modules",
